From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: acqxi <kacqxi@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:17:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] WSL host bridge: Local host bridge card in Connections

Settings > Connections shows the bridge's state from the Desktop helper and
the WSL backend's native link list: Discovering, Waiting for Windows or WSL,
Bridge starting, Pairing required, Connected, Recovering, Permission denied,
Identity mismatch, Disabled. Enable mints a code on Windows and links WSL to
it after the user confirms. The card never pairs on its own. It also offers
Disable, Revoke, access changes and diagnostics.
